        "cooked": "<p><font color=\"green\"><span class=\"bbcode-i\">&lt;Split from <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/several-questions-about-damage-interaction-5350\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Several questions about damage interaction</a>&gt;</span></font></p>\n<p>TEMPEST CHAIN LIGHTNING: nothing is simultaneous, so, can each chain be directed to a \"single\" target? The card says first, second and third target, so I assumed not. But, target is anything with HP.</p>",
