        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-06T16:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"marv\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/8e8cbc/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> marv:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>TEMPEST CHAIN LIGHTNING: nothing is simultaneous, so, can each chain be directed to a \"single\" target? The card says first, second and third target, so I assumed not. But, target is anything with HP.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Chain Lightning is just trying to convay that you can't hit the \"same\" target with each of those instances. But they do happen one at a time.</p>\n<p>Ronway, you should get a Dragon tattoo like Fixers and Operatives. You are a ninja</p>",
